---
// CtaDownload: Direct download action and call to action
---

<section id="unduh" class="section download-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="download-card">
      <div class="download-content">
        <h2>Siap Memberikan Rasa Aman untuk Keluarga Anda?</h2>
        <p>
          Pasang FamLoop di ponsel Anda dan anak sekarang. Rasakan ketenangan pikiran mengetahui mereka telah tiba dengan selamat di tujuan.
        </p>
        <div class="download-buttons">
          <a href="#unduh" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" onclick="alert('FamLoop APK Android v1.0 siap diunduh! File APK akan mulai diunduh.')">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path>
              <polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline>
              <line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line>
            </svg>
            Unduh APK FamLoop untuk Android
          </a>
          <a href="#cara-kerja" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">
            Panduan Pemasangan
          </a>
        </div>
        <span class="compatibility-note">
          Kompatibel dengan ponsel Android 7.0 (Nougat) hingga Android 14+ • Ukuran aplikasi ringan
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .download-section {
    background-color: var(--surface);
  }

  .download-card {
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, var(--primary-subtle), var(--surface-alt));
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 4rem 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .download-content {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .download-content h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .download-content p {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  .download-buttons {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .btn-lg {
    padding: 0.95rem 2rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .compatibility-note {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: block;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .download-card {
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
    }
    .download-buttons {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .btn-lg {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
